cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: szl-holdings/szl-evidence-mandate — Scientific evidence gate (PASS/FAIL/ABSTAIN/ERROR receipts,
  mutation testing, fixtures)
abstract: >-
  A Scientific Evidence Gate engine (manifest-declared inputs, a hash-chained invocation ledger,
  PASS/FAIL/ABSTAIN/ERROR receipts and mutation testing against generated fixtures) plus read-only,
  evidence-backed audits of the szl-holdings GitHub organisation and the SZLHOLDINGS Hugging Face
  estate. Receipts are UNSIGNED unless an Ed25519 key is configured. A receipt supports integrity,
  provenance and replayability; it does not establish scientific truth, accuracy, safety or fitness
  for use.
version: 0.1.2
date-released: '2026-10-30'
